       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum.\n\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is above the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose.\n- **Daily total:** The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under prescriber supervision. Most inpatients get 1,200\u20132,400 mg/day.\n- **Risks:** This dose would greatly raise the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function and no allergies don't change that.\n\nDid you mean one of these usual regimens?\n- 400\u2013800 mg by mouth every 6\u20138 hours (three or four times daily), not more than 3,200 mg/day\n- 600 mg by mouth four times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg by mouth three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you really do intend 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give the clinical rationale. I would still want to flag it for pharmacist review before entering it."
